  {
   "key": "func WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.evaluate(context:state:interval:unitsImperial:)",
   "hash": "209e3e1c50f2bbdf",
   "does": "Before 60 s elapsed returns (nil, state). Otherwise resolves the marker unit and the current marker index. If the state counts a different unit (interval or units changed mid-workout) it returns no payload and a fresh split starting now with the current index counted. Else, if the index exceeds state.lastMarkerIndex, returns makePayload's payload plus a new split anchored at the current distance/elevation gain/elapsed; otherwise no payload and the state with its unit recorded.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.swift::func WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.resolvedUnit(for:unitsImperial:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.swift::func WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.markerIndex(context:unit:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.swift::func WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.splitStarting(at:unit:index:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.swift::func WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.makePayload(context:state:unit:index:)"
   ],
   "reads": [],
   "writes": [],
   "branches": [
    {
     "at": "+6",
     "cond": "context.elapsedSeconds >= 60",
     "effect": "false: returns (nil, unchanged state) to avoid a GPS-jitter mile in the first minute; true: continue"
    },
    {
     "at": "+9",
     "cond": "state.markerUnit set and differs from the resolved unit",
     "effect": "returns (nil, split starting now at the current index in the new unit)"
    },
    {
     "at": "+14",
     "cond": "currentIndex > state.lastMarkerIndex",
     "effect": "false: returns (nil, state with markerUnit set); true: payload and next state. If several markers were crossed since last tick only the latest index is announced, its split spanning all of them"
    }
   ],
   "deps": {
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.swift::func WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.makePayload(context:state:unit:index:)": "4c951a6b0bfc9379",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.swift::func WorkoutMileMarkerEngine.markerIndex(context:unit:)": "4a0270c056cbf020",
